{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24455","headline":"追欢偶作 · 白居易","name":"追欢偶作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"追欢逐乐少闲时，补贴平生得事迟。\n何处花开曾後看，谁家酒熟不先知。\n石楼月下吹芦管，金谷风前舞柳枝。\n十听春啼变莺舌，三嫌老丑换蛾眉。\n乐天一过难知分，犹自咨嗟两鬓丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}